      "type": "quote",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "M = [int(i) for i in open('17.txt')]\nA = [i for i in M if i % 73 == 0 and i > 0]\ncount = 0\nmaxi = 0\nfor i in range(0, len(M)-1):\n    if all(M[i] >= x for x in A) and all(M[i+1] >= x for x in A):\n        count += 1\n        maxi = max(maxi, M[i] + M[i+1])\nprint(count, maxi)"
        }
      ]
